WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:03.361
A city office gets a request to hold a street race.

00:03.686 --> 00:06.286
One AI model could answer yes or no.

00:06.611 --> 00:10.059
But when it's wrong, there's nothing to check or fix.

00:10.559 --> 00:13.276
Permit Engine splits that decision into parts you can

00:13.322 --> 00:16.434
inspect. It's automatic and AI assisted,

00:16.643 --> 00:19.104
yet every step leaves a trace.

00:19.904 --> 00:23.468
First, evidence. The AI must quote its source.

00:23.793 --> 00:25.976
This police letter promises an escort,

00:26.092 --> 00:28.948
but for the wrong date. A separate check compares the

00:29.006 --> 00:31.096
dates, and rejects the letter.

00:31.896 --> 00:36.180
Second, escalation. Small question trees score risk.

00:36.424 --> 00:38.583
A contradiction, missing insurance,

00:38.792 --> 00:42.090
or a risk that isn't clearly low goes to an officer,

00:42.148 --> 00:43.970
with the reason attached.

00:44.770 --> 00:49.031
Third, learning. Officer reviews adjust the numbers inside

00:49.077 --> 00:53.176
those trees. The written rules never change by themselves.

00:53.676 --> 00:56.544
In this demo, an AI plays the officer.

00:56.822 --> 00:59.655
On cases set aside, the trees matched our answer key

00:59.771 --> 01:01.559
70 percent of the time at first,

01:01.733 --> 01:05.379
and 87 percent after 115 reviews.

01:06.179 --> 01:08.408
This pattern isn't only for races.

01:08.733 --> 01:11.241
In a bank, income papers are the evidence,

01:11.450 --> 01:13.633
fraud and default are the risks,

01:13.842 --> 01:16.210
and a mismatch goes to an analyst.

01:16.710 --> 01:19.682
In government benefits, the law supplies the rules,

01:19.856 --> 01:22.283
and a caseworker takes the hard cases.

01:22.783 --> 01:26.103
And when an AI agent is about to move money or delete

01:26.150 --> 01:28.855
data, treat that action as an application.

01:29.134 --> 01:31.444
What supports it? What could go wrong?

01:31.653 --> 01:33.278
Does it need a person?

01:33.778 --> 01:35.775
We've only tested on made-up permits,

01:35.949 --> 01:37.598
so it shows the method can learn,

01:37.714 --> 01:39.537
not that it predicts real risk.

01:39.862 --> 01:41.394
Automatic where it can be,

01:41.603 --> 01:45.156
traceable every time, and a person for the hard cases.
